---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Mood Matching – Get Paired Based on How You Feel | Airwalk Blog" description="Airwalk's mood matching pairs you with strangers who feel the same way. Select your mood, find your match, have better chats.">
  <header class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Airwalk</a>
      <a href="/chat" class="bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition">Start Chatting</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-12 space-y-6 mt-20">
    <article class="space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">Mood Matching: Find Strangers Who Feel the Same Way You Do</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Published on June 2, 2026</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Ever joined a chat feeling reflective but got matched with someone hyper and chaotic? Mood mismatch kills conversations before they start. Airwalk's mood matching feature solves this by pairing you with people who are on the same emotional wavelength.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">How Mood Matching Works</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Before you enter a chat, you select your current mood from options like Chill, Energetic, Deep Talks, Playful, Venting, or Curious. Airwalk's algorithm then matches you with someone who selected the same or a complementary mood. It's simple, fast, and makes a dramatic difference in conversation quality.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Why Your Mood Matters More Than Interests</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">You might share interests with someone but be in completely different headspaces. A music lover who wants to vent about their day doesn't want to debate album rankings right now. Mood matching respects where you are emotionally in this moment — not just what topics you generally enjoy.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Better Matches, Better Conversations</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">When two people enter a conversation with aligned energy, magic happens. Both want the same type of interaction. Nobody feels drained or annoyed. Conversations last longer, go deeper, and leave both people feeling genuinely good about the exchange.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Change Your Mood Anytime</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Your mood at 2PM might be different from your mood at 2AM. Airwalk lets you update your mood selection before every new match. Feeling playful this morning? Select it. Need someone to listen tonight? Switch to Venting. Your mood, your rules.</p>

      <p class="text-gray-300">Stop leaving conversations to chance. Match your mood, match your vibe.</p>
    </article>

    <div class="text-center py-8 border-t border-gray-800">
      <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">Ready to match with someone on your wavelength?</p>
      <a href="/chat" class="inline-block bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-medium transition">Match My Mood</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="border-t border-gray-800 py-8 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Airwalk. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>
